    "Only 3x112 descriptor coordinates are weighted; original5 feature blocks/IQ/F/G/default head unchanged.",
    "between=variance of class support means, within=sum within-class squared residuals/(n-C). relative=(between/(within+mean_view(within)+eps64)), divided by view mean; no-between evidence gives uniform view. weight=1-eta+eta*relative.",
    "All stats use current support labels. Per-view reunit after weighting. Weights are fixed for each query; K1 is exactly R9 because no physical within-class estimate.",
    "Source K1 rule reused only from prior source-only R9 selection. Strength selected on5RX x2 episodes91/92 with held32 disjoint max20 support; no target scores.",
    "Conditional target has2 arms R11/R9C with shared identical F/G feature extraction; each arm uses same physical K labels. Names and metric keys distinct.",
    "P03 is exposed development, not blind confirmation. All predeclared predictions fixed before independent scoring."
  ]
